.TH pcx-info 1  "pcx 0.1.1"
.SH NAME
pcx\-info \- Show MCAP container metadata without decoding point frames
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpcx info\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT.mcap\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show MCAP container metadata without decoding point frames
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print versioned JSON instead of human\-readable text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT.mcap\fR>
MCAP Source to inspect
